<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bill yields lower again at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bill yields lower again at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills fell on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> One month    3.36	  3.53	 7	    0.5   1.8  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  3.72	  3.89	 8	    1.0   3.27 1.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
